 "remarks": "Amazing value in Wilton! Extensively updated, this charming Colonial offers the perfect blend of classic character and modern convenience. Featuring a newly renovated kitchen, updated bathrooms, refinished hardwood flooring, a new heating system, updated electrical, a new roof, and fresh paint throughout. Among others, a new well cap adds to the list of important improvements. The warmth and character has been thoughtfully preserved, which is what makes this home so special. Ideally located just minutes from town, schools, shopping, dining, and commuter routes, 20 Mountain Road is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy all that Wilton has to offer in a home that is truly move-in ready.",
